OL,3,GNEWSAChurch offers support after murder
OL,4,Aarrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA vicar is calling for people to let
OL,7,Fpolice carry out their work without
OL,8,Fspeculating after the "devastating"
OL,9,Fdeath of a woman in Alderney.
OL,11,FGuernsey Police arrested a 44-year-old
OL,12,Fman on suspicion of murder on Monday
OL,13,Fafter the woman was found dead at the
OL,14,Fbottom of cliffs in Alderney on Sunday
OL,15,Fevening.
OL,17,FThe vicar of Alderney Parish Church,
OL,18,FReverend Samantha Martell said the
OL,19,Fchurch was there for anyone who needed
OL,20,Fsupport and her "love, thoughts and
OL,21,Fprayers" were with everyone affected.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,442,440,260,160,0,100
