OL,3,GNEWSAChurch offers support after murder
OL,4,Aarrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said: "This is a devastating time
OL,7,Ffor our small community. Alderney is
OL,8,Fclose-knit and I'd ask people to be
OL,9,Fpatient, kind to one another, and to
OL,10,Flet the police carry out their work
OL,11,Fwithout speculation."
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
